//　身ごなしを観察すれば、仕手の力量と騎体性能の程
//は明らかだった。
  From the way they fly, I can easily judge their capabilities, and the capabilities of their machines.

  Both are first-rate, as I'd expect. Colonel Cannon handpicked these pilots for this mission, and the ST-9 is the absolute cutting edge of Western dragoon technology. These are demons with wings, and I cannot hope to fend them off while pursuing my mission.

//　どちらも極めて高度。
//　当然だ――前者はキャノン中佐が信任して極秘作戦
//の一翼を担わせた人材、後者は国際連盟軍の最新鋭騎
//ＳＴ-〇九なのだから。

//　<RUBY text='ウイングドデーモン'>空の悪魔</RUBY>と呼ばれるに相応しい者ども。
